   1. I configure connection and read timeouts for service-to-service communication.
   2. I use Circuit Breaker to prevent repeated calls to an unhealthy service.
   3. I use controlled retries with exponential backoff for transient failures and avoid retrying non-idempotent operations blindly.
   4. For partial failures, I use fallbacks where appropriate, monitoring, correlation IDs and asynchronous messaging where suitable.

