   1. I would implement a heartbeat mechanism from the client application.
   2. Each checkout stores the last heartbeat timestamp.
   3. If no heartbeat is received within the configured timeout, the checkout is marked expired and the seat is released.
   4. A background cleanup job can periodically identify and release stale checkouts.

